## The 3 Push Notification Triggers

| # | Event | Recipient | Push Title | Route on Tap |
|---|-------|-----------|-----------|--------------|
| 1 | Customer creates booking | **Technician** | 🔧 New Booking Request! | `/(tabs)/home` |
| 2 | Technician accepts/declines | **Customer** | ✅ Booking Accepted! / ❌ Booking Declined | `/(tabs)/bookings` |
| 3 | Payment verified | **Technician** | 💰 Payment Received! | `/wallet` |

